Vocabulary (upd1)

 Core

| Pattern | Meaning | JS idea |
|---------|---------|--------|
`app Name` | Program / class | `class Name { … }`
`fn name(a, b):` | Function / method | `name(a, b) { … }`
`return x` | Return | `return x;` |
`print x` | Log to Console | `console.log(x)` 
`id "btn"` | Remember a DOM id | `getElementByIdControl
 class "btn" | getElementByClassName

| Pattern | Meaning | JS idea |
|---------|---------|--------|
`if` / `else if` / `else` | Branches | `if / else if / else` 
`wait N` | Pause N seconds | `await` + `setTimeout` 
`loop N` | Every N seconds | `setInterval` 

Math

| Pattern | Meaning |
|---------|--------|
`math floor x` | Floor 
math random` | Integer 0–9 
math random+` | Integer 1–10 
`math random * n` | Scale (float) 
`math random / n` | Scale (float) 

State & page text 

| Pattern | Meaning | JS idea |
|---------|---------|--------|
| `score = 0` | Variable on the app | `this.score = 0` 
| `score = score + 1` | Update | `this.score = this.score + 1` 
| `put score in "score-label"` | Show on page | `element.textContent = …
| `put "hello" in "out"` | Set text to a string | same 

Events

 `"btn" clicked?:` | Click on element `id="btn"` 
 `fn "btn"` | Alias for click on `btn` 
 `key "w" clicked?:` | Key W 
 `key "space" clicked?:` | Space bar 
 `key "lmb" clicked?:` | Left mouse button 

Effects & sensing (host hooks)

| Pattern | Emits (idea) |
|---------|----------------|
"damage" => "enemy"` | `applyEffect("damage", "enemy")` 
let "player" forward` | `moveEntityForward("player")` 
sense cursor` / `sense "npc"` | `setupSense(…)` 
sense "a" near "b"` / `"a" far "b"` | `setRelation(…)` 

Hosts may stub these with `console.log` in the browser bundle.




